  "description": "Yoon Onghyeon has a hard time while working at a cafe called Season Cafe in Jeju. He resigns and then comes to the cafe because he trusts a senior of his, but it's about to close down. A man is surprisingly hired when they are about to give up saving the cafe, but what bothers Yoon Onghyeon is that the man is his ex-boyfriend who was abdoned by him. Facing the trouble of unemployment and bad relationships, will he succeed in both his career and love? \n\n(Source: Webnovel)",
